      "text": "The vertical line through P6 crosses the horizontal line through P10 at P11. The vertical line through P1, turned by 135°, crosses the horizontal line through P10 at P12. The vertical line through P1, turned by 135°, crosses the vertical line through P9 at P13. Draw a line through P11 at 90° to line OE. Draw a line through P12 at 90° to line OE. Draw a line through P13 at 90° to line OE. Turn the new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
